commit 8aa384a518283fb3a772211425892c4e72c65843
Author: Josh <slyhounddog@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 11 09:46:12 2026 -0600

    Add Layout tab to the dev tool: visual editor for the DOM UI
    
    The real game runs in an iframe served from the tool's origin (/game/),
    booted from a fixture save with audio silenced and walked to a chosen
    screen (18 presets). Click/drag/resize/nudge elements and edit their text
    and CSS; edits are saved as overrides, never into the game's source:
    css/layout.json (source of truth), generated css/layout.css (linked last
    in index.html) and js/LayoutOverrides.js (static text overrides).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

